        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρώας</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππος</span> a <i>chestnut</i> horse (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταξὺ τεφροῦ καὶ πυρροῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phot.
				</span></i>
			), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ παρῶαἱ ἵπποι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					630a29
				</span></i>
			 : fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρόα</span></b> ,
				<u>PPetr.</u>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				3p.159
			</span></i> (cf. p.xviii) ; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραύα</span></b> , ibid.; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρούα</span></b> , ib.<i><span class="en">
				2p.117
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαλοπάραυος</span>.</div>
